sequenceDiagram
  actor Driver
  participant Platform
  participant OpMode as L110Follower<br/>OpMode
  Driver->>Platform: presses INIT
  Platform->>OpMode: init()
  Note over Platform,OpMode: the INIT diagram shows what init() does
  loop until PLAY
    Platform->>OpMode: init_loop()
  end
  Driver->>Platform: presses PLAY
  Platform->>OpMode: start()
  Note over Platform,OpMode: the PLAY diagram shows what start() and loop() do
  loop until STOP
    Platform->>OpMode: loop()
  end
  Driver->>Platform: presses STOP
  Platform->>OpMode: stop()
  Note over Platform,OpMode: the STOP diagram shows what stop() does
